        <mxCell id="p-rules" value="RESPONSIVE ACCEPTANCE&#xa;&#xa;• 44px minimum practical targets&#xa;• Drawer closes on navigation / Escape&#xa;• Active route remains obvious&#xa;• VI / EN / RU labels stress-tested&#xa;• Dialogs fit 320px width&#xa;• Tables adapt without page overflow&#xa;• Typography preserves diacritics / Cyrillic&#xa;• One primary CTA per page" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D8E1EC;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1240" y="590" width="280" height="255" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
